---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我 - 栋木遇楠枫" description="关于栋木遇楠枫个人介绍">
  <div class="page-banner">
    <a href="/" class="back-home">← 返回首页</a>
    <h1 class="banner-title">关于我</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="about-container" style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 8% 80px;">
    <style>
      .about-container { padding: 0 8% 80px; }
      .about-section {
        background: var(--color-bg-card);
        border-radius: var(--color-radius-card);
        padding: 28px 32px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px var(--color-shadow);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        transition: all 0.3s;
      }
      .about-section h2 {
        font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text); transition: color 0.3s;
      }
      .about-section p {
        color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 12px; transition: color 0.3s;
      }
      .skill-wrap {
        display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px;
      }
      .skill-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        background: var(--color-tag-bg);
        color: var(--color-tag-text);
        border-radius: var(--color-radius-tag);
        font-size: 13px;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .skill-tag:hover {
        background: var(--color-primary);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .contact-box {
        background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .about-container { padding: 0 5% 60px; }
        .about-section { padding: 20px; }
      }
    </style>

    <div class="about-section">
      <h2>个人简介</h2>
      <p>在校网络安全方向学习者，专注Web渗透、代码审计、Linux运维相关技术。日常记录漏洞复现、靶场实操、工具使用、编程学习笔记。</p>
      <p>搭建独立博客用于沉淀学习内容，方便自我复盘，同时分享实战教程给同好交流。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <h2>技术栈</h2>
      <div class="skill-wrap">
        <span class="skill-tag">Web渗透测试</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">SQL注入/XSS/命令注入</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">BurpSuite工具开发</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Linux服务器运维</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">PHP/Java代码审计</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">HTML/CSS/JS</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">WordPress建站</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Vulnhub靶场实战</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <h2>本站说明</h2>
      <p>本站为独立自建站，基于 Astro 静态生成框架，所有文章以 Markdown 格式存储，无数据库依赖。</p>
      <p>内容仅用于网络安全技术学习交流，禁止任何非法渗透、攻击行为。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section contact-box">
      <h2>交流方式</h2>
      <p>站点留言：文章底部评论区可提问交流</p>
      <p>内容范围：漏洞复现、工具使用、建站问题、安全学习路线</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
